# Keep the Docker build context lean and predictable.
#
# This file is at the repository root on purpose. docker-compose.yml builds
# with the REPOSITORY ROOT as the context (`context: ..`,
# `dockerfile: .devcontainer/Dockerfile`), and docker reads
# `<context>/.dockerignore` — so a `.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile was
# never read by this build. Without a root file, every rebuild ships the whole
# checkout to the daemon, including node_modules and whatever the Android app
# build has left in the tree.
.git
.gitignore
node_modules
.pi
*.log

# Android build leftovers (the pi-termux-mobile app build; see .gitignore).
# The APKs are ~100 MB each, so they dwarf everything else in the context.
.artifacts
local.properties
*.apk
